# 1. Ignore everything
**/*

# 2. Add files and directories that should be included
!apps/**
!libs/**
# The catalogs of every language the apps ship (i18n/TRANSLATING.md).
!i18n/**
!infra/**
!deno.jsonc
# The MPA renders the API reference from this file.
!docs/token-api.md
!deno.lock

# 3. Bonus step: ignore any unnecessary files that may be inside those allowed directories in Step #2
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/node_modules
**/build
**/dist
**/Dockerfile
**/dockerfile
**/dockerfile.*
**/_fresh

# 4. Never let a secret into an image. On the server these folders hold the env file and the Web
#    Push key, and a developer may keep a .env beside an app; Compose hands the containers what they
#    need at run time (environment, a bind mount).
infra/envs
infra/configs
**/.env*
